  "text": "'WANGARA LAUNCHING NEWCASTLE STATE MOCKYARD\n16/\"1/53\nThe Director of\nThe Fate Dockeyard. Newcastle\nrequests the pleasure of the Company of\nMr. a Mos. b. I. McFadyen C. B.E.\nLaunching of the\nTwin Serer Vehicular-Passenger Ferry\nPrincess of Jasmania\nDame\nPattie Menzies\nLaterdug 730 Recordan 1958\nR.S.V.P.\nPO.\nBox\n431,\nNewcastle,\nnot later than 5/12/58 to bermit\nCard of Entree being\nissued.\nGuests are invited to use perts\nService from Merewether\nStreet\nWharf commencing at\n8.30 8.11.",
